  "teaches": [
    "On successful completion, you will be able to explain why at-least-once delivery makes idempotency mandatory.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to implement an idempotency key that makes a retried action safe.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to design a checkpointing scheme that keeps a resumed agent run consistent with the run it continues."
